config PROFILE_ARM64
    prompt "Target profile"
    type choice
    var ROSCONFIG_PROFILE
    value generic "Generic ARM64"
    value rpi5    "Raspberry Pi 5"
    default generic
    depends ARCH=arm64
    help
      Generic builds the architecture-independent ARM64 target.

      Raspberry Pi 5 adds the Pi boot firmware and device trees together
      with the RP1 Ethernet, CYW43455 Wi-Fi, and VC4 display drivers.
      Optional modules are selected independently in the Modules submenu.
